{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"REV","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"啟示錄","commonName":"啟示錄","title":"啟示錄","order":66,"numberOfChapters":22,"sha256":"a6e9abf9f2b18b66a3d18f7888eb972005db7cc9695e64c58c95480a09f6f5a7","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/REV/1.json","lastChapterNumber":22,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/REV/22.json","totalNumberOfVerses":402},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["天上的敬拜"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["此後，我再觀看，見天上有一扇門開了，又聽見之前那個像號角般響亮的聲音對我說：「你上這裡來，我要把以後必發生的事指示給你看。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["我便立刻被聖靈感動，看見天上安設著一個寶座，有一位坐在寶座上，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["閃耀著碧玉和紅寶石般的光彩。有一道翡翠般的彩虹圍繞著寶座。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["寶座的周圍設有二十四個座位，有二十四位長老身穿白衣，頭戴金冠，坐在上面。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["從寶座發出閃電、響聲、雷鳴，寶座前面燃燒著七把火炬，代表",{"noteId":10},"上帝的七靈。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["寶座前還有一個水晶般的玻璃海，寶座的四周環繞著四個活物，他們前後都長滿了眼睛。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["第一個活物像獅子，第二個像牛犢，第三個有人的面孔，第四個像飛鷹。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["這四個活物各有三對翅膀，翅膀內外都長滿眼睛。他們晝夜不停地說：",{"text":"「聖哉！聖哉！聖哉！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主上帝是昔在、今在、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以後永在的全能者。」","poem":1},{"noteId":11}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["每逢這些活物將榮耀、尊貴、感謝獻給坐在寶座上、活到永永遠遠的那位時，"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["二十四位長老就俯伏在坐寶座的那位面前，敬拜活到永永遠遠的那位，又把他們的冠冕放在寶座前，說："]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"「我們的主，我們的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你配得榮耀、尊貴和權能，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因你創造了萬物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬物都因你的旨意被創造而存在。」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":10,"caller":"+","text":"「代表」希臘文是「就是」。","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":5}},{"noteId":11,"caller":"+","text":"以賽亞書6·3。","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":8}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/REV/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/REV/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/REV/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}